      "content": "ESM pitfall: LAND, PGRD, REFR, ACHR and ACRE records do not carry their own cell formID. The owning cell must be recovered by tracking the label of the enclosing GRUP with groupType == 6 (CellChildren). Two code paths need this: the file parse path uses a groupInfoStack and the memory parse path uses m_currentCellFormID. Oblivion GRUP types: 0=TopLevel, 1=WorldChildren, 2=InteriorCellBlock, 3=InteriorCellSubBlock, 4=ExteriorCellBlock, 5=ExteriorCellSubBlock, 6=CellChildren, 7=TopicChildren, 8=CellPersistentChildren, 9=CellTemporaryChildren. Also note SubRecord has no empty() member; use size() > 0.",
